# Ignore everything
*

# Whitelist config and customizations
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!bootstrap.sh
!agents-skill-lock.json
!agents-skills/
!agents-skills/**
!agents/
!agents/**
!rules/
!rules/**
!status_lines/
!status_lines/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**

# skills/ is whitelisted PER-SKILL, never wholesale — this repo is PUBLIC and
# some local skills document client systems and must not be published. Add a new
# line here only after confirming the skill is generic. Symlinked skills are not
# tracked either; bootstrap.sh recreates them from agents-skill-lock.json so a
# fresh clone never lands with dangling links.
!skills/
!skills/code-reviewer/**
!skills/frontend-design/**
!skills/prd-reviewer/**

# Never:
#   projects/**   — transcripts AND per-project memory (client-internal)
#   *.bak*        — settings backups
